      "summary": "Verify this release cosign verify \\ --key https://raw.githubusercontent.com/BerriAI/litellm/e82a3c646908ba0a6ee0beddc4310d7a6cac4065/cosign.pub \\ ghcr.io/berriai/litellm:v1.106.5 Same command for litellm-database , litellm-non_root and the docker.io/litellm/* images What's new in 1.106.5 1 PR. 1 changed. No action needed to upgrade Changes Logging and observability: Changed failure logs for rejected requests to keep only core request fields, tags and guardrail details (#48599 ) Also in 1.103.10 , 1.104.8 , 1.105.6 Logging and observability: Changed the GCS logger to use the bucket and credentials configured on the proxy (#48599 ) Also in 1.103.10 , 1.104.8 , 1.105.6 Backport #48605 · Full changelog",
